How to train and evaluate models ?

[1] download go-basic files with the version of 2023-04-24 in data/ dir:
    go-basic.obo: https://release.geneontology.org/2024-04-24/ontology/go-basic.obo
    go-basic.owl: https://release.geneontology.org/2024-04-24/ontology/go-basic.owl
    go-plus.owl:  https://release.geneontology.org/2024-04-24/ontology/extensions/go-plus.owl
    rename go-basic.obo as go.obo
    rename go-basic.owl as go.owl

[2] Normalize go-basic files:
    groovy groovy/Normalizer.groovy -i data/go.owl -o data/go.norm
    groovy groovy/makeEl.groovy data/go-plus.owl data/go-plus-el.owl
    groovy groovy/Normalizer.groovy -i data/go-plus-el.owl -o data/go-plus.norm

[3] Copy following files in data/mf/bp/cc dir:
    train/valid/test_gene_list, train/valid/test_gene_list, train/valid/test_sequence.fasta, term_list

[4] Create term.pkl files:
    python Create_Term_File.py data/

[5] Create interpros.pkl files:
    python Create_InterPro_File.py data/

[6] Create training/evaluate/test dataset:
    python Create_DataSet data/

[7] Training models:
    ./train_se.sh deepgozero_esm mf cuda:0 # training DeepGO-SE
    ./train_se.sh deepgozero mf cuda:0 # training DeepGOZero
    python train_cnn.py -ont mf -d cuda:0

[8] Evaluate models:
    python evaluate.py -m deepgocnn -ont mf # evaluate single models
    python evaluate_entailment.py -m deepgozero_esm -ont mf # evaluate multiple models
    We should modify metrics.py and evaluate_entailment.py

How to evaluate DeepGOPlus ?

[1] Modify traincnn.py 

[2] Use the DeepGOCNN model in evaluate/test dataset:
    python traincnn.py -ont mf -td valid -ld -d cuda:0
    python traincnn.py -ont mf -td test  -ld -d cuda:0

[3] Deal prediction results:
    python Deal_Results_DeepGOCNN.py workdir
    workdir includes MF/BP/CC dir, each of which includes term_list, evaluate/test_gene_label, evaluate/test_gene_list, and evaluate/test_predictions_deepgocnn.pkl.

[4] Post-deal prediction results for finding parents terms:
    python Post_Deal_DeepGOCNN.py workdir

[5] Combine DeepGOCNN and Diamond to create DeepGOPlus results:
    python Combine_Result.py rootdir
    rootdir includes deepgocnn and diamond workdirs.







    
